  <result type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xE9;sultats atteints</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xE9;sultats atteints</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Parmi les r&#xE9;sultats obtenus jusqu&apos;&#xE0; la fin du projet (mars 2021) : 1) d&#xE9;livr&#xE9; 10,000 actes de naissance  &#xE0; des personnes d&#xE9;plac&#xE9;es internes, dont 5,183 femmes et 4,817 hommes; 2) d&#xE9;livr&#xE9; 20,000 actes de naissance &#xE0; 10,366 femmes et 9,634 hommes de la population h&#xF4;te; 3) d&#xE9;livr&#xE9; 8,000 cartes nationales d&apos;identit&#xE9; burkinab&#xE8; &#xE0; 4,000 femmes et 4,000 hommes de la population h&#xF4;te; 4) d&#xE9;livr&#xE9; 12,000 cartes nationales d&#x2019;identit&#xE9; burkinab&#xE8; &#xE0; des personnes d&#xE9;plac&#xE9;es internes, dont 6,220 femmes et 5,780 hommes.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results achieved as of the end of the project (March 2021) include: (1) issued 10,000 birth certificates to internally displaced persons, including 5,183 women and 4,817 men; (2) issued 20,000 birth certificates to 10,366 women and 9,634 men from the host community; (3) issued 8,000 Burkina Faso national identity cards to 4,000 women and 4,000 men from the host community; and (4) issued 12,000 Burkina Faso national identity cards to internally displaced persons, including 6,220 women and 5,780 men.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
  <result type="2">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Expected Results</narrative>
    <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xE9;sultats escompt&#xE9;s</narrative>
   </title>
   <indicator measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Results expected</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">R&#xE9;sultats escompt&#xE9;s</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="FR">Les r&#xE9;sultats escompt&#xE9;s de ce projet comprennent : 1) favoriser l&#x2019;exercice des droits civiques et politiques, particuli&#xE8;rement le droit de voter; 2) faciliter la libre circulation des personnes d&#xE9;plac&#xE9;es &#xE0; l&#x2019;int&#xE9;rieur du pays.</narrative>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">The expected outcomes for this project include: (1) promoting the exercise of civil and political rights, particularly the right to vote; and (2) facilitating the free movement of internally displaced persons.</narrative>
    </description>
   </indicator>
  </result>
